\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  1. \cf0  O, Jesus Christ, look upon us,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 and give your good spirit to us,
\par and lead us with thy precious grace
\par and lead us to thy perfect way.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. Our tongues shall sing to you thy praise,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj and our hearts shall pray unto you;
\par strengthen our faith, and cleanse our  hearts,
\par to make us see thy wisdom right.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Do unto us until the day
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0  that we in-collaboration
\par  with thy great church shall see thy face
\par  and sing to praise thee in thy throne.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  Glory be unto the father,
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0  son and the Holy Ghost always.
\par  O, God the given of our life,
\par  we give to you thy thanks and praise.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

